  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Seatalk to NMEA-0183 converter.
            This subclasses <see cref="T:Iot.Device.Nmea0183.NmeaSinkAndSource" /> and hence can be included in a <see cref="T:Iot.Device.Nmea0183.MessageRouter" />, which will make
            the Seatalk interface look very similar to an NMEA-0183 interface.
            This class embeds the <see cref="T:Iot.Device.Seatalk1.SeatalkInterface" />, so no extra instance is required if this class is used. The class supports translation
            of directly wrapped seatalk messages (that start with $STALK) as well as a set of navigation messages (see <see cref="P:Iot.Device.Seatalk1.SeatalkToNmeaConverter.SentencesToTranslate" />)
            </summary>
    <remarks>To be added.</remarks>
  </Docs>
